    A[User Input: Ingredients] --> B[Streamlit Web UI]
    B --> C[Retriever (ChromaDB)]
    C --> D[Relevant Recipe Context]

    %% The Prompt Template receives both the user's question and the retrieved context
    B -- "question" --> E[Prompt Template]
    D -- "context" --> E

    E --> F[LLM (Google Gemini)]
    F --> G[Recipe Answer (JSON)]
    G --> H[Streamlit UI: Display Result]

